WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.839
Step 1. Open the Immunizations tab of the encounter.

1.2
00:00:03.839 --> 00:00:08.186
You record an immunization in an open encounter of the patient.

1.3
00:00:08.186 --> 00:00:12.827
The tab shows the Schedule and the doses under Administered.

2.1
00:00:12.827 --> 00:00:18.451
Step 2. Open the Record immunization sheet. Select Record immunization.

2.2
00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:23.824
The sheet records a vaccine given in this encounter, a historical dose,

2.3
00:00:23.824 --> 00:00:26.519
or a dose that was not given.

3.1
00:00:26.519 --> 00:00:29.897
Step 3. Enter the vaccine and what happened.

3.2
00:00:29.897 --> 00:00:33.239
Search the Vaccine list and select the vaccine.

3.3
00:00:33.239 --> 00:00:38.926
Status stays Completed, and Administered on defaults to now; it cannot be in the

3.4
00:00:38.926 --> 00:00:48.313
future.

4.1
00:00:48.313 --> 00:00:51.690
Step 4. Enter the administration details.

4.2
00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:57.487
These optional fields show only for a Completed dose: the dose and its unit,

4.3
00:00:57.487 --> 00:01:18.582
the route, the body site, who gave it, and where.

5.1
00:01:18.582 --> 00:01:27.671
Step 5. Add a note. Type a note if you need to. The note is optional free text.

6.1
00:01:27.671 --> 00:01:32.263
Step 6. Save the immunization. Select Save immunization.

6.2
00:01:32.263 --> 00:01:38.156
Care shows Immunization recorded, and the record appears under Administered,

6.3
00:01:38.156 --> 00:01:40.982
newest first, with its status.
